{"id":"A1-L021","title":"Present Continuous: introduction","cefr":"A1","level":"A1","unit":"A1-U02","focus":"Present Continuous — introdução","targets":{"grammar":"Present Continuous — introdução","pron":"think/this","verbs":["run"],"pv":[],"expr":[],"words":["race","park","thousand","gate","grape","pear","peach","strawberry"],"field":"Rotina","genre":"Anúncio, folheto, aviso","skill":"Fala","words_min":8},"frames":[{"tag":"Abertura","title":"Lesson 21 · Present Continuous: introduction","blocks":[{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Nesta aula","body":["**Foco:** Present Continuous — introdução.","**Verbos:** run.","**Pronúncia:** think/this.","**8 palavras novas** (rotina).","**Texto do dia:** anúncio, folheto, aviso."]},{"type":"p","t":"**Objetivo de comunicação (A1):** eu consigo dizer o que está acontecendo agora e ler um anúncio."},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Ponte para as provas","body":["Você ainda não faz as provas, mas já treina o formato de tarefas curtas que elas usam.","Esta aula treina **responder em frases completas (IELTS Speaking, TOEFL Speaking)**."]}]},{"tag":"Aquecimento","title":"Warm-up · Say the words","blocks":[{"type":"p","t":"Toque em 🔊, ouça e repita cada palavra. Depois tente adivinhar o sentido."},{"type":"words","items":[["race","corrida"],["park","parque"],["thousand","mil"],["gate","portão"],["grape","uva"],["pear","pera"],["peach","pêssego"],["strawberry","morango"]]}]},{"tag":"Leitura","title":"Reading · An advertisement","blocks":[{"type":"ad","title":"Run for Fun!","lines":["Right now, people are **running** in the park. Are you running? **Join** us!","Thousands of people are **running**, **walking** and **smiling**.","The race is **happening** today. Come and **watch**!","Sign up now at the park gate."],"gloss":[["race","corrida"],["thousand","mil"],["sign up","inscrever-se"],["gate","portão"]]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"People are running in the park.","ans":"T","why":"“are running.”"},{"q":"The race is tomorrow.","ans":"F","why":"“today.”"},{"q":"You can only watch.","ans":"F","why":"Join."},{"q":"The race is free.","ans":"NG","why":"Não diz."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“race” means…","opts":["corrida","festa","pausa"],"ans":0,"why":"race = corrida."},{"q":"“gate” means…","opts":["portão","janela","porta"],"ans":0,"why":"gate = portão."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"Present Continuous","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Sujeito","be","verbo + -ing"],"rows":[["I","**am**","**running**"],["he / she / it","**is**","**running**"],["we / you / they","**are**","**running**"]],"cap":"Agora"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Quando usar","body":"Para ações **acontecendo agora**: *I am running.* Palavras: **now, right now, at the moment**."},{"type":"box","kind":"warn","t":"Cuidado","body":"Regras de -ing: run → **running** (dobra a consoante), make → **making** (tira o e), study → **studying**."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"They ___ in the park. (run)","a":"are running","why":"they → are running.","say":"They are running"},{"s":"She ___ now. (walk)","a":"is walking","why":"she → is walking."},{"s":"I ___ to music. (listen)","a":"am listening","why":"I → am listening."},{"s":"We ___ the race. (watch)","a":"are watching","why":"we → are watching."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["race","corrida"],["park","parque"],["thousand","mil"],["gate","portão"],["grape","uva"]]},{"type":"order","title":"Put the words in order","items":[{"words":["it","fun","Is"],"ans":"Is it fun","pt":"É divertido?"},{"words":["us","Yes","join"],"ans":"Yes join us","pt":"Sim, junte-se!"}]}]},{"tag":"Vocabulário","title":"Words and expressions","blocks":[{"type":"vocab","items":[{"w":"race","pos":"noun","pt":"corrida","ex":"The race is today.","expt":"A corrida é hoje."},{"w":"park","pos":"noun","pt":"parque","ex":"The park is big.","expt":"O parque é grande."},{"w":"thousand","pos":"noun","pt":"mil","ex":"A thousand people.","expt":"Mil pessoas."},{"w":"gate","pos":"noun","pt":"portão","ex":"The gate is open.","expt":"O portão está aberto."},{"w":"grape","pos":"word","pt":"uva","ex":"Sweet grapes.","expt":"Uvas doces."},{"w":"pear","pos":"word","pt":"pera","ex":"A ripe pear.","expt":"Uma pera madura."},{"w":"peach","pos":"word","pt":"pêssego","ex":"A juicy peach.","expt":"Um pêssego suculento."},{"w":"strawberry","pos":"word","pt":"morango","ex":"Strawberry cake.","expt":"Bolo de morango."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"culture","t":"Expressões desta aula","body":["**What are you doing?** — O que você está fazendo?","**I’m running.** — Estou correndo.","**Are they running too?** — Eles também estão correndo?"]}]},{"tag":"Verbos","title":"Verbs in focus","blocks":[{"type":"verbs","items":[{"v":"run","pt":"correr","forms":[["I run","I run in the park."],["you run","You run fast."],["he / she / it runs","She runs every day."],["we / they run","We run together."]],"note":"Em -ing: **running** (dobra o n)."}]}]},{"tag":"Escuta e diálogo","title":"At the park","blocks":[{"type":"dialog","title":"At the park","lines":[["Ana","What are you doing?","O que você está fazendo?"],["Leo","I’m running.","Estou correndo."],["Ana","Are they running too?","Eles também estão correndo?"],["Leo","Yes, they are.","Sim."],["Ana","Is it fun?","É divertido?"],["Leo","Yes, join us!","Sim, junte-se!"]]},{"type":"pron","title":"Pronúncia: think/this","items":[{"label":"think/this","note":"Escute a diferença: I am running /aɪ əm ˈrʌnɪŋ/ → na fala: I’m running.","words":["I’m running","I’m walking","I’m reading"]}]}]},{"tag":"Fala","title":"Speaking","blocks":[{"type":"speak","title":"Speaking","prompts":[{"q":"Say what you are doing now.","pt":"Diga.","model":"I’m studying English now."},{"q":"Ask: What are you doing?","pt":"Pergunte.","model":"What are you doing?"},{"q":"Say what people are doing.","pt":"Diga.","model":"They are running."}]}]},{"tag":"Escrita","title":"Writing","blocks":[{"type":"write","task":"Write 5 sentences about what is happening now.","model":"I am studying. My brother is watching TV. It is raining. The dog is sleeping. We are happy.","checklist":["Usei **am/is/are + -ing**","Usei **now**","Usei **3 sujeitos**"],"words":"5 frases"}]},{"tag":"Revisão e exame","title":"Review · Exam strategy · Teacher’s note","blocks":[{"type":"mcq","title":"Check yourself","items":[{"q":"What does “race” mean?","opts":["parque","portão","corrida"],"ans":2,"why":"**race** = corrida."},{"q":"What does “park” mean?","opts":["parque","mil","uva"],"ans":0,"why":"**park** = parque."},{"q":"What does “thousand” mean?","opts":["portão","mil","pera"],"ans":1,"why":"**thousand** = mil."},{"q":"What does “gate” mean?","opts":["uva","pêssego","portão"],"ans":2,"why":"**gate** = portão."},{"q":"Which is correct?","opts":["She is running.","She running.","She runs now."],"ans":0,"why":"is + -ing."}]},{"type":"box","kind":"exam","t":"Estratégia para as provas","body":["Em **Listening**, “right now” indica Present Continuous.","Em **Writing**, não esqueça o **be** antes do -ing."]},{"type":"box","kind":"teach","t":"Nota para o futuro professor","body":["Faça **mímicas**: um aluno mima, os outros dizem *You are…*","Treine **regras de -ing**.","Erro típico: *“She running.”* → *She is running.*"]}]}]}